      ],
      "bbox": [
        567.0,
        594.0,
        706.0,
        667.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The mean vector and covariance matrix can be partitioned similarly as",
      "source_page": 212,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "p212:b11"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        209.0,
